  missionName: Red Planet Expedition
  targetDestination: Mars (Jezero Crater)
  estimatedDuration: 2.5 Earth Years
  description: Embark on humanity's first crewed interplanetary voyage. Execute atmospheric entry into the Martian atmosphere, explore ancient river deltas for biosignatures, and return to Earth.
